象外です（今夜の厳選・出尽くしサイン・レーティング変化・注目開示などの注目銘柄のみ、毎晩の実行で場中の5分足を取得して分析します）。</div><div class=\"spwrap\"><div class=\"nhead\">値動きと長期支持帯<span class=\"spbtns\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '1')\">1年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn on\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '3')\">3年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '10')\">10年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, 'all')\">全期間(23年)</button></span></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"1\" style=\"display:none\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"60.2\" width=\"320\" height=\"2\" fill=\"#c62f2f\" opacity=\"0.12\"/><polyline points=\"4.0,97.2 9.1,91.6 14.2,93.6 19.3,94.0 24.5,91.9 29.6,90.9 34.7,92.8 39.8,95.4 44.9,94.5 50.0,87.4 55.1,85.6 60.3,86.6 65.4,85.6 70.5,85.6 75.6,79.8 80.7,78.2 85.8,79.6 91.0,79.7 96.1,73.6 101.2,68.4 106.3,61.7 111.4,63.1 116.5,63.5 121.6,69.5 126.8,78.4 131.9,76.8 137.0,75.6 142.1,78.7 147.2,80.5 152.3,80.8 157.4,74.9 162.6,67.7 167.7,53.9 172.8,56.3 177.9,48.4 183.0,44.4 188.1,40.6 193.2,21.8 198.4,22.4 203.5,31.0 208.6,25.1 213.7,19.8 218.8,15.6 223.9,12.8 229.0,15.4 234.2,14.0 239.3,31.0 244.4,29.3 249.5,57.4 254.6,38.0 259.7,39.6 264.9,38.2 270.0,50.2 275.1,51.7 280.2,56.3 285.3,55.2 290.4,57.3 295.5,53.6 300.7,49.6 305.8,38.5 310.9,45.7 316.0,60.7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1c1c1e\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M 249.5 69.4 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 290.4 69.3 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><circle cx=\"316.0\" cy=\"60.7\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#1c1c1e\"/></svg></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"3\" style=\"display:\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"59.1\" width=\"320\" height=\"2\" fill=\"#c62f2f\" opacity=\"0.12\"/><po